---
import './design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from './SketchSheet.astro';
---
<figure id="constraint-overview" class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface constraint-overview wide" aria-labelledby="constraint-overview-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Shared enforcement</span>
  <h3 id="constraint-overview-title">Every writer meets the same reference rule</h3>
  <div class="overview-layout">
    <div class="writers">
      <h4>Ways to write an order line</h4>
      <div class="writer-sheets">
        <SketchSheet><div class="writer"><strong>Checkout service</strong><span>A customer buys a product.</span></div></SketchSheet>
        <SketchSheet><div class="writer"><strong>Bulk importer</strong><span>A script brings in earlier purchases.</span></div></SketchSheet>
        <SketchSheet><div class="writer"><strong>Administration tool</strong><span>A member of staff corrects a line.</span></div></SketchSheet>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="write-arrow">
      <svg class="converging-paths" viewBox="0 0 100 300" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 50 L28 50 Q46 50 46 70 L47 150 M3 150 L92 150 M3 250 L28 250 Q48 250 47 230 L47 150 M76 138 L94 150 L76 162" /><path class="pencil-pass" d="M5 52 L29 52 Q44 52 44 72 L45 147 M5 152 L91 152 M5 252 L29 252 Q50 252 49 232 L49 152" /></svg>
      <span>All three write <br />to these tables</span>
    </div>
    <div class="database">
      <h4>Inside the database</h4>
      <SketchSheet tone="teal">
        <p class="rule"><strong>Required product reference</strong><br />The line’s product ID must match a product.</p>
        <p class="products">Existing products: <code>P7</code>, <code>P8</code></p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Line names <code>P7</code></dt><dd><strong>Passes this rule</strong><span>P7 exists.</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Line names <code>P99</code></dt><dd><strong>Rejected</strong><span>No product P99 exists.</span></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The reference is a foreign key. Each writer gets the same result for the same attempted reference, even if it omitted its own validation. Passing this rule alone does not guarantee that the write succeeds: its other fields must satisfy their constraints too.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .constraint-overview.wide { margin-left:50%; }
  .overview-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) 7rem minmax(0,1.15fr); gap:1rem; align-items:center; margin:1.6rem 0 3.5rem; }
  .overview-layout h4 { margin-bottom:.7rem; }
  .writers { display:contents; }
  .writers h4 { grid-column:1; grid-row:1; }
  .writer-sheets { display:grid; gap:.7rem; grid-auto-rows:1fr; grid-column:1; grid-row:2; }
  .database { grid-column:3; grid-row:1 / span 2; align-self:center; }
  .writer { padding:.15rem 0; }
  .writer strong,.writer span { display:block; }
  .writer span { margin-top:.2rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:.8rem; }
  .write-arrow { position:relative; grid-column:2; grid-row:2; align-self:stretch; text-align:center; color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:.75rem; }
  .write-arrow span { display:block; position:absolute; top:calc(100% + .5rem); left:0; right:0; }
  .converging-paths { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; color:var(--teal); overflow:visible; }
  .converging-paths path { fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.1; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke; }
  .converging-paths .pencil-pass { opacity:.4; stroke-width:.6; }
  .design-figure .rule { margin:.15rem 0 .8rem; }
  .design-figure .products { padding:.55rem 0; margin:0; border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); }
  dl { margin:0; }
  dl > div { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap:.6rem; padding:.75rem 0; }
  dl > div + div { border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  dt,dd { margin:0; font-size:.8rem; }
  dd span { display:block; margin-top:.2rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  @media(max-width:650px) {
    .overview-layout { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:.9rem; }
    .writers { display:block; }
    .writer-sheets,.database,.write-arrow { grid-column:auto; grid-row:auto; }
    .write-arrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; padding-left:1rem; text-align:left; }
    .write-arrow .converging-paths { position:static; width:2.7rem; height:4rem; transform:rotate(90deg); margin:0 .7rem; }
    .write-arrow span { position:static; margin:0; }
    .write-arrow br { display:none; }
  }
</style>
